                <br />
                <BitTag>BitThemeManager</BitTag>: <BitTag>SetThemeAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>ToggleDarkLightAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>GetCurrentThemeAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>GetCurrentPersistedThemeAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>IsSystemInDarkModeAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>ApplyBitThemeAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>ClearBitThemeOverridesAsync</BitTag>, <BitTag>EnsureThemeNotificationsRegisteredAsync</BitTag>
